{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sugar Sling Showdown, protect, nurture and build a world of candy where your tongue is your ultimate weapon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Unique Tongue Mechanics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Grapple, fling, and interact with the environment and enemies using innovative and chaotic tongue-powered gameplay.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/3540f54e986ecf2419d67cf7b305ba6b.poster.avif?t=1774040542\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/3540f54e986ecf2419d67cf7b305ba6b.webm?t=1774040542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/3540f54e986ecf2419d67cf7b305ba6b.mp4?t=1774040542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Party game modes:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Challenge your friends to different pvp, pve game modes and assert dominance in the candy world.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/71f3e4d37c272df5488d5a28e3f44937.poster.avif?t=1774040542\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/71f3e4d37c272df5488d5a28e3f44937.webm?t=1774040542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/71f3e4d37c272df5488d5a28e3f44937.mp4?t=1774040542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Co-op mode:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Work on Toffee Town together with your friends.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/70980d6407fd49852d807b80c7bbb086.poster.avif?t=1774040542\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/70980d6407fd49852d807b80c7bbb086.webm?t=1774040542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/70980d6407fd49852d807b80c7bbb086.mp4?t=1774040542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4. Nurture and Build:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nurturing rescued babies that'd determine the well being and development of Toffee Town adds a distinct flavor to a simplified colony sim.</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/fb53eb3d91a7f06ecb7dffd8d3ee4c2e.poster.avif?t=1774040542\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/fb53eb3d91a7f06ecb7dffd8d3ee4c2e.webm?t=1774040542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/fb53eb3d91a7f06ecb7dffd8d3ee4c2e.mp4?t=1774040542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5. Sweet fantasy:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A distinct flavor of candy and veggie built world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/d3abb923a7eac3a4a2288e246e421ebf.poster.avif?t=1774040542\" width=426 height=240 ><so